Third-party components
======================

JetBrains Mono (https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono)
  Copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors
  SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1: fonts/OFL.txt. In this repository as
  fonts/JetBrainsMono-Regular.ttf, embedded in the program (Reef/Fonts.lean)
  for the text it draws.

The rest is not part of this repository: the build fetches it.

webgpu-raw-lean (https://github.com/lancelet/webgpu-raw-lean)
  Apache-2.0 or MIT. The WebGPU bindings, which the demo requires; their
  NOTICE lists what they in turn fetch or link: wgpu-native (MIT or
  Apache-2.0) and SDL3 (zlib License), linked natively; Dawn's emdawnwebgpu
  (BSD 3-Clause), Lean 4's runtime and libuv (Apache-2.0, MIT), linked on the
  web; and webgpu-headers' documentation (BSD 3-Clause).
